Quest Lumberjack Duties Peon Near tree
    Events
        Time - Every 0.20 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        (LumberPeon is alive) Equal to True
    Actions
        Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of LumberPeon)
        Destructible - Pick every destructible within 250.00 of VarPoint and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Destructible-type of (Picked destructible)) Equal to Pine Tree
                        ((Picked destructible) is alive) Equal to True
                        (Distance between (Position of LumberPeon) and (Position of Nazgrek)) Less than or equal to 250.00
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- DEBUG --------
                        Game - Display to (All players) the text: (DEBUG:  + (LumperPeon >>  + Peon near tree))
                        -------- DEBUG --------
                        -------- Set follow --------
                        Set VariableSet FollowSystem_Source = LumberPeon
                        Set VariableSet FollowSystem_Target = Nazgrek
                        Custom script:   call FollowSystem_RemoveUnit(udg_FollowSystem_Source)
                        Unit - Order LumberPeon to Harvest (Picked destructible)
                    Else - Actions
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
